---
import Layout from '@src/layouts/Layout.astro'
import cc from './_cc.svg'
---

<Layout title="About">
  <div class="tint--type">
    <h1>About</h1>

    <p>
      Hi!<br />Pretends to be Drawing seems to be some sort of slice of life
      webcomic? I never really settled on what it actually is about. But it <em
        >is</em
      >, and maybe that is enough!
    </p>

    <p>
      If you want to follow this comic on social media: Hey, maybe don't! Make a
      bookmark! But if you really want to there is an <a
        href="https://instagram.com/pretendstobedrawing/"
        rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow"
        target="_blank">Instagram</a
      > and <a
        href="https://facebook.com/pretendstobedrawing/"
        rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow"
        target="_blank">Facebook</a
      > account where I post new comics exclusively.
    </p>

    <p>
      I also have <a
        href="https://mastodon.social/@JulianaGaibler"
        rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow"
        target="_blank">Mastodon</a
      >, <a
        href="https://bsky.app/profile/juliana.me"
        rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow"
        target="_blank">Bluesky</a
      > that are not strictly for this comic, and just... me stuff. Oh I also have
      a <a href="https://juliana.me/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">website</a
      >! Wow!
    </p>

    <h2>Feed</h2>
    <p>
      There is an <a href="/feed">ATOM Feed</a>, a <a href="/feed/rss"
        >RSS Feed</a
      > and a <a href="/feed/json">JSON Feed</a> you can subscribe to.
    </p>
    <h2>License</h2>

    <p>
      <img class="license" src={cc.src} alt="Creative Commons License" />
      The comics are licensed under <a
        href="http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/?ref=chooser-v1"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International</a
      >
    </p>

    <h2>Permalinks</h2>
    <p>
      I am trying to guarantee that the links listed here will always work, no
      matter what.
    </p>
    <pre
      class="tint--tinted"><code>ptbd-comic.com/comic/[comicID]
ptbd-comic.com/share/[comicID].png</code></pre>
    <pre
      class="tint--tinted"><code>ptbd-comic.com/feed
ptbd-comic.com/feed/rss</code></pre>
    <pre
      class="tint--tinted"><code>ptbd-comic.com/archive
ptbd-comic.com/archive/[year]</code></pre>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style lang="sass">
  .license
    max-width: 200px
    display: block
    margin: 1rem auto
</style>
